  realmDialogue:
  - "Ah... I see. If that is your final decision-cough-I suppose I can\u2019t do anything to change your mind."
  - "R-cough-really, my lord? If that\u2019s your decision, I am be forever grateful. "
  thingsPersonSays:
  - key: Hello... cough, cough... my son, he told you of my condition?
    value:
    - He did. But tell me more.
    - "Ma\u2019am... I can\u2019t let you go into the Human Realm."
  - key: "You\u2019re a compassionate man, my lord... cough... Well... where do I begin..."
    value:
    - ...
    - 
  - key: "Oh... wheezing sounds... well... I suppose there\u2019s not much else to talk about, then..."
    value:
    - ...
    - 
  - key: "Long ago, I was a queen. I birthed a son, who you\u2019ve met, who I loved and doted upon with all my heart."
    value:
    - Where were you the queen of?
    - How did he become so powerful?
  - key: None5
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: But maybe you should consider a little longer... my son... is very powerful, you know.
    value:
    - Are you threatening a Bodhisattva?
    - 
  - key: None6
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: "Oh-cough-Kushinakoku. You may know it as the Kingdom of Kushinagar. It\u2019s a beautiful country, my lord."
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: "Well, when my husband, when he learned that it\u2019d grant us the most karmic merit possible, sent my boy away into monasticism."
    value:
    - But he is no ordinary monk.
    - 
  - key: None9
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: None10
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: "No, my lord, I would never... but his actions are out of my control... and it\u2019s hard to think of a person who wouldn\u2019t be upset were their mother damned to Hell."
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: None12
    value:
    - 
