  - key: None16
    value:
    - 
    -
  - key: "No, he isn\u2019t. I reckon he became this powerful because of the prayers I poured into him during his studies. It was hard to be away from him for so long. But-cough-I found many ways to support him. I sent him food, clothes, supplies. I spent not a cent on myself."
    value:
    - ...or the temples.
    - How kind of you.
