  - key: "My son... he never got the chance to see me before I died. It\u2019s-cough-humiliating... I never wanted him to see me like this...I\u2019m sorry if... I treated you harshly, Bodhisattva Jizo. I\u2019m just... filled with regret over how I lived my life."
    value:
    - "Do you think you\u2019ve earned a second chance?"
    - "I still can\u2019t send you to the Human Realm."
