  endingDialogue:
  - "My lord... you\u2019ve heard everything I have to say. You know of my misdeeds. If you believe I am-cough-still deserving of damnation, do what you must. I apologize, Bodhisattva, if my son gives you trouble for your decision. I have... cough... come to accept that your judgment is fair and just."
